#: windows.cpp:195
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, a window in the background will automatically come "
"to the front when the mouse pointer has been over it for some time."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, küse uğı arta torğan berär täräzä ütkändä ul täräzä eş "
"üzägenä çığarılaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:197
msgid ""
"This is the delay after which the window that the mouse pointer is over will "
"automatically come to the front."
msgstr "Bu ara uzğaç qına, küse ütkän täräzä alğa yözep çığaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:201
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the active window will be brought to the front "
"when you click somewhere into the window contents. To change it for inactive "
"windows, you need to change the settings in the Actions tab."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, eşçän täräzä eçtälegenä çirtkändä ul täräzä eş üzägenä "
"çığarılaçaq. Arttağı täräzälärgä dä şulay uqı itü öçen, Eşlär digän tabaqta "
"bulğan köylämälärne üzgärtäse."

#: windows.cpp:206
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, there will be a delay after which the window the "
"mouse pointer is over will become active (receive focus)."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, küse uğı arta torğan berär täräzä ütkändä ul täräzä "
"beraz kötterep kenä eş üzägenä çığarılaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:208
msgid ""
"This is the delay after which the window the mouse pointer is over will "
"automatically receive focus."
msgstr "Bu ara uzğaç qına, küse uğı ütkän täräzä eş üzägenä çığaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:213
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Küçeş"

#: windows.cpp:217
msgid "Show window list while switching windows"
msgstr "Täräzä arasında küçkändä täräzälär tezmäsen kürsätäse"

#: windows.cpp:220
msgid ""
"Hold down the Alt key and press the Tab key repeatedly to walk through the "
"windows on the current desktop (the Alt+Tab combination can be reconfigured).\n"
"\n"
"If this checkbox is checked a popup widget is shown, displaying the icons of "
"all windows to walk through and the title of the currently selected one.\n"
"\n"
"Otherwise, the focus is passed to a new window each time Tab is pressed, with "
"no popup widget.  In addition, the previously activated window will be sent to "
"the back in this mode."
msgstr ""
"Basılğan Alt töymäse belän bergä Tab töymäse aşa biredäge östäldä bulğan "
"täräzälär arasında küçep bula (Alt-Tab çaptırmasın üzgärtep tä bula).\n"
"\n"
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, atılma widget eçendä täräzälär tamğalarınnan torğan "
"tezmä kürsäteläçäk.\n"
"\n"
"Yuq isä, Tab basılğan sayın eşüzäk kiläse täräzägä küçäçäk, soñğı eşçän täräzä "
"isä ul tezmä azağına quyıla. Bu çaqta atılma widget kürsätelmi inde. "

#: windows.cpp:231
msgid "&Traverse windows on all desktops"
msgstr "&Bar öställärdäge täräzälär arasında"

#: windows.cpp:234
msgid ""
"Leave this option disabled if you want to limit walking through windows to the "
"current desktop."
msgstr ""
"Ağımdağı östäl täräzäläre arasında ğına küçäse kilsä, bu köylämäne sünderäse."

#: windows.cpp:238
msgid "Desktop navi&gation wraps around"
msgstr "Äylän&mä buyınça küçü"

#: windows.cpp:241
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want keyboard or active desktop border navigation "
"beyond the edge of a desktop to take you to the opposite edge of the new "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylänmä yanıq bulsa, ağımdağı östäl çigennän çıqqan çaqta ikençe östälgä "
"küçü bulaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:245
msgid "Popup desktop name on desktop &switch"
msgstr "Östäl &saylaw atılmasında östäl adın kürsätäse"

#: windows.cpp:248
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you wish to see the current desktop name popup whenever "
"the current desktop is changed."
msgstr "Atılma täräzädä ağımdağı östäl adın kürsätü öçen bonı yandırası."

#: windows.cpp:526
msgid "Shading"
msgstr "Külägäläw"

#: windows.cpp:528
msgid "Anima&te"
msgstr "Canlan&dıru"

#: windows.cpp:529
msgid ""
"Animate the action of reducing the window to its titlebar (shading) as well as "
"the expansion of a shaded window"
msgstr ""
"Täräzäne başlıqqa törü belän başlıqtan kire torğızu eşlären canlandırıp kürsätü"

#: windows.cpp:532
msgid "&Enable hover"
msgstr "&Ütüne açası"

#: windows.cpp:542
msgid ""
"If Shade Hover is enabled, a shaded window will un-shade automatically when the "
"mouse pointer has been over the title bar for some time."
msgstr ""
"Küse uğı başlıqqa törelgän täräzä östendä beraz torğanda ul täräzä üzennän üze "
"torğızılaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:545
msgid ""
"Sets the time in milliseconds before the window unshades when the mouse pointer "
"goes over the shaded window."
msgstr ""
"Küse uğı başlıqqa törelgän täräzä östendä tuqtaludan soñ, ul täräzä üzennän üze "
"torğızılğançı kötteräse ara bu. Millisekund belän ülçänä."

#: windows.cpp:556
msgid "Active Desktop Borders"
msgstr "Eşçän Östäl Çikläre"

#: windows.cpp:559
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, moving the mouse to a screen border will change your "
"desktop. This is e.g. useful if you want to drag windows from one desktop to "
"the other."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, küse uğı östäl çigennän uzğanda ağımdağı östäl "
"almaşınaçaq. Berär täräzäne ber östäldän ikençe östälgä östergändä bu närsä "
"uñaylı bula ala."

#: windows.cpp:562
msgid "D&isabled"
msgstr "Sü&nek"

#: windows.cpp:563
msgid "Only &when moving windows"
msgstr "Täräzä &küçergändä genä"

#: windows.cpp:564
msgid "A&lways enabled"
msgstr "&Barçaq açıq"

#: windows.cpp:569
msgid "Desktop &switch delay:"
msgstr "Östäl arasında &küçü arası:"

#: windows.cpp:570
msgid ""
"Here you can set a delay for switching desktops using the active borders "
"feature. Desktops will be switched after the mouse has been pushed against a "
"screen border for the specified number of milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Küse uğı östäl çigennän ütkännän soñ, eş östälen almaştırğançı kötteräse ara "
"bu. Millisekund belän ülçänä."

