msgid ""
"_: Focus Stealing Prevention Level\n"
"High"
msgstr "Yuğarı"

#: windows.cpp:589
msgid ""
"_: Focus Stealing Prevention Level\n"
"Extreme"
msgstr "Extreme"

#: windows.cpp:593
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This option specifies how much KWin will try to prevent unwanted focus stealing "
"caused by unexpected activation of new windows. (Note: This feature does not "
"work with the Focus Under Mouse or Focus Strictly Under Mouse focus policies.)"
"<ul>"
"<li><em>None:</em> Prevention is turned off and new windows always become "
"activated.</li>"
"<li><em>Low:</em> Prevention is enabled; when some window does not have support "
"for the underlying mechanism and KWin cannot reliably decide whether to "
"activate the window or not, it will be activated. This setting may have both "
"worse and better results than normal level, depending on the applications.</li>"
"<li><em>Normal:</em> Prevention is enabled.</li>"
"<li><em>High:</em> New windows get activated only if no window is currently "
"active or if they belong to the currently active application. This setting is "
"probably not really usable when not using mouse focus policy.</li>"
"<li><em>Extreme:</em> All windows must be explicitly activated by the user.</li>"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Eşüzäkneñ başqa täräzägä kiräkmägän küçü bulmasın öçen, KWin bonda saylanğan "
"tärtip buyınça eşläyäçäk.</p>"

#: windows.cpp:754
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Täräzälär"

#: windows.cpp:762
msgid "Di&splay content in moving windows"
msgstr "Täräzä &küçergändä eçtälegen kürsätäse"

#: windows.cpp:764
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be fully shown while "
"moving it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not be "
"satisfying on slow machines without graphic acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Täräzä küçergändä anıñ qısasın ğına tügel, eçtälegen dä kürsätü öçen bu "
"köylämäne açası. Sızu köçäytkeçe bulmağan sanaqlarda bu ısul äkren eşli."

#: windows.cpp:768
msgid "Display content in &resizing windows"
msgstr "Täräzä ü&lçäme üzgärtkändä eçtälegen kürsätäse"

#: windows.cpp:770
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be shown while resizing "
"it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not be "
"satisfying on slow machines."
msgstr ""
"Täräzä ülçämen üzgärtkändä anıñ qısasın ğına tügel, eçtälegen dä kürsätü öçen "
"bu köylämäne açası. Sızu köçäytkeçe bulmağan sanaqlarda bu ısul äkren eşli."

#: windows.cpp:774
msgid "Display window &geometry when moving or resizing"
msgstr "Täräzä küçerü/ereräytü çağında anıñ ülçämen kürsätäse"

#: windows.cpp:776
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's geometry to be displayed while it is "
"being moved or resized. The window position relative to the top-left corner of "
"the screen is displayed together with its size."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, berär täräzä küçerü/ereräytü çağında anıñ ülçäme "
"kürsäteläçäk. "

#: windows.cpp:786
msgid "Animate minimi&ze and restore"
msgstr "Törep/tö&zätep quyunı canlandırası"

#: windows.cpp:788
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want an animation shown when windows are minimized or "
"restored."
msgstr ""
"Täräzä törü/cäyü çağında bu eşne canlandıru öçen bu köylämäne yandırası."

#: windows.cpp:802
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "Äkren"

#: windows.cpp:806
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Tiz"

#: windows.cpp:810
msgid ""
"Here you can set the speed of the animation shown when windows are minimized "
"and restored. "
msgstr "Täräzä törü/cäyü çağında canlandıru tizlegen bonda köyläp bula. "

#: windows.cpp:816
msgid "Allow moving and resizing o&f maximized windows"
msgstr "&Cäyelgän täräzäne küçerergä/keçeräytergä birü"

#: windows.cpp:818
msgid ""
"When enabled, this feature activates the border of maximized windows and allows "
"you to move or resize them, just like for normal windows"
msgstr ""
"Cäyep quyılğan täräzäneñ dä ülçämen üzgärtä alu öçen bu koylämäne yandırası."

#: windows.cpp:824
msgid "&Placement:"
msgstr "&Urınlaşu:"

#: windows.cpp:827
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "Aqıllı"

#: windows.cpp:828
msgid "Cascade"
msgstr "Öyep"

#: windows.cpp:829
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Oçraqlı"

#: windows.cpp:830
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "Üzäkläşep"

#: windows.cpp:831
msgid "Zero-Cornered"
msgstr "Sul Poçmaq"

#: windows.cpp:838
msgid ""
"The placement policy determines where a new window will appear on the desktop. "
"<ul> "
"<li><em>Smart</em> will try to achieve a minimum overlap of windows</li> "
"<li><em>Cascade</em> will cascade the windows</li> "
"<li><em>Random</em> will use a random position</li> "
"<li><em>Centered</em> will place the window centered</li> "
"<li><em>Zero-Cornered</em> will place the window in the top-left corner</li>"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"Östäldä yaña täräzäneñ kürsätelüe urınlaşu tärtibenä buysına. "
"<ul> "
"<li><em>Aqıllı</em> başqa täräzälärne qaplaw kimräk bulsın itü</li> "
"<li><em>Ber-Ber Artlı</em> täräzälärne ber-ber artlı öyü</li> "
"<li><em>Oçraqlı</em> oçraqlı urınlaşu qullanu</li> "
"<li><em>Üzäkläşep</em> täräzäne üzäktä kürsätü</li> "
"<li><em>Sul Poçmaq</em> täräzäne oşke sul poçmaqta urınlaştıru</li></ul>"

#: windows.cpp:874
msgid "Snap Zones"
msgstr "Çik Alanı"

#: windows.cpp:878 windows.cpp:888
msgid "none"
msgstr "yuq"

#: windows.cpp:880
msgid "&Border snap zone:"
msgstr "&Çikkä çirtü alanı:"

#: windows.cpp:881 windows.cpp:891
msgid " pixels"
msgstr " noqta"

#: windows.cpp:883
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for screen borders, i.e. the 'strength' of the "
"magnetic field which will make windows snap to the border when moved near it."
msgstr ""
"Östäl çigendä täräzäne çikkä tartuçı ara kiñlege, yäğni tärazälärne östäl "
"çigenä tartuçı ara."

#: windows.cpp:890
msgid "&Window snap zone:"
msgstr "&Täräzägä çirtü alanı:"

#: windows.cpp:893
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for windows, i.e. the 'strength' of the magnetic "
"field which will make windows snap to each other when they're moved near "
"another window."
msgstr ""
"Täräzä çigendä täräzäne çikkä tartuçı ara kiñlege, yäğni tärazälärne ber "
"bersenä yabıştıruçı ara."

#: windows.cpp:897
msgid "Snap windows onl&y when overlapping"
msgstr "Täräzälär qaplansa ğına &tartıp quyası"

#: windows.cpp:898
msgid ""
"Here you can set that windows will be only snapped if you try to overlap them, "
"i.e. they will not be snapped if the windows comes only near another window or "
"border."
msgstr ""
"Täräzälär ber bersen qaplap torsalar ğına alarnı östäl çigenä yä ki ber bersenä "
"tartıp quyası."

#: windows.cpp:1181
msgid ""
"<qt><b>It seems that alpha channel support is not available.</b>"
"<br>"
"<br>Please make sure you have <a href=\"http://www.freedesktop.org/\">"
"Xorg &ge; 6.8</a>, and installed the kompmgr that came with kwin."
"<br>Also, make sure you have the following entries in your XConfig (e.g. "
"/etc/X11/xorg.conf):"
"<br>"
"<br><i>Section \"Extensions\""
"<br>Option \"Composite\" \"Enable\""
"<br>EndSection</i>"
"<br>"
"<br>And if your GPU provides hardware-accelerated Xrender support (mainly "
"nVidia cards):"
"<br>"
"<br><i>Option     \"RenderAccel\" \"true\"</i>"
"<br>In <i>Section \"Device\"</i></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>Alfa-kanal totu yuq kebek toyıla.</b>"
"<br>"
"<br><a href=\"http://www.freedesktop.org/\">Xorg &ge; 6.8</a> "
"belän, kompmgr yazılımnarnıñ quyılğan buluın tikşerep alası."
"<br>Bonnan tış, XConfig eçendä (ü.ö. /etc/X11/xorg.conf) kiläse keremnär buluın "
"da tikşeräse:"
"<br>"
"<br><i>Section \"Extensions\""
"<br>Option \"Composite\" \"Enable\""
"<br>EndSection</i>"
"<br>"
"<br>Bu sanaqtağı GPU eçendä Xrender totılu buluın (nVidia kard öçen):"
"<br>"
"<br><i>Option     \"RenderAccel\" \"true\"</i>"
"<br>In <i>Section \"Device\"</i></qt>"

